{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01621","headline":"杂曲歌辞 君子有所思行 二 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 君子有所思行 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安得龙猛笔，点石爲黄金。\n散问酷吏家，使无贪残心。\n甘棠密叶成翠幄，颍凤不来天地塞。\n所以倾城人，如今不可得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}